From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:16:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 062/117] mfd: simple-mfd-i2c: support 8-bit Chestnut registers

Apple's existing simple I2C PMIC match data configures a 16-bit register
address with 8-bit values. Chestnut uses the same simple MFD parent model
but addresses its registers with eight bits, so reusing apple,i2c-pmic
would send malformed transactions.

Add Chestnut-specific match data which selects the existing
8-register/8-value regmap configuration and associate it with
apple,chestnut-pmic. Child devices continue to be populated by
simple-mfd-i2c and share the parent-owned regmap.

Keeping the format in per-compatible match data preserves normal regmap
lifetime, probe and removal handling. It avoids both a device-tree
register-width property and a special case in the MFD or regmap cores. The
complete kernel series built Image.gz, DTBs and modules, and the live D111
PMIC bound through simple-mfd-i2c without Chestnut or regmap errors. This
patch was checked with checkpatch.pl --strict.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: bb4061f9aae16a40f40ab5d1bd6f9386f2475dd8
---
 drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c b/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c
index 8a81d7acc..636afd117 100644
--- a/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c
+++ b/drivers/mfd/simple-mfd-i2c.c
@@ -76,6 +76,10 @@ static const struct simple_mfd_data apple_i2c_pmic = {
 	.regmap_config = &regmap_config_16r_8v
 };
 
+static const struct simple_mfd_data apple_chestnut_pmic = {
+	.regmap_config = &regmap_config_8r_8v
+};
+
 static const struct mfd_cell sy7636a_cells[] = {
 	{ .name = "sy7636a-regulator", },
 	{ .name = "sy7636a-temperature", },
@@ -125,6 +129,7 @@ static const struct simple_mfd_data spacemit_p1 = {
 };
 
 static const struct of_device_id simple_mfd_i2c_of_match[] = {
+	{ .compatible = "apple,chestnut-pmic", .data = &apple_chestnut_pmic },
 	{ .compatible = "apple,i2c-pmic", .data = &apple_i2c_pmic },
 	{ .compatible = "delta,tn48m-cpld" },
 	{ .compatible = "fsl,ls1028aqds-fpga" },
